#: ../../source/docs/mavproxy-developer-gcs.rst:5
#: cd69ecd997aa4872a7235fc9b803a7f5
msgid "MAVProxy Developer GCS"
msgstr "MAVProxy 开发者地面站"

#: ../../source/docs/mavproxy-developer-gcs.rst:7
#: c99dab91d86e489db25334c241325fae
msgid ""
":ref:`MAVProxy <mavproxy:home>` is a powerful command-line based "
"\"developer\" ground station software that complements your favorite GUI "
"ground station, such as *Mission Planner*, *APM Planner 2* etc. It has a "
"number of key features, including the ability to forward the messages from "
"your UAV over the network via UDP to multiple other ground station software "
"on other devices."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MAVProxy <mavproxy:home>` 是一款功能强大的命令行「开发者」地面站软件，可与 *Mission "
"Planner*、*APM Planner 2* 等图形界面地面站配合使用。它具有多项关键功能，包括能够通过 UDP "
"将无人机消息转发到网络上的多个其他设备地面站软件。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavproxy-developer-gcs.rst:14
#: b504a143aa9e468fa146a377efbb0d91
msgid ""
"MAVProxy is commonly used by developers (especially with SITL) :ref:`for "
"testing new builds <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing>`."
msgstr ""
"MAVProxy 常被开发者（尤其结合 SITL）用于 :ref:`测试新构建版本 <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-"
"testing>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavproxy-developer-gcs.rst:16
#: ff9cb3014003444a9c4c483e834189ca
msgid ""
"The :ref:`MAVProxy Documentation<mavproxy:home>` contains detailed "
"information on how to use the tool."
msgstr ":ref:`MAVProxy 文档 <mavproxy:home>` 包含关于如何使用该工具的详细信息。"
